h crystalline membrane on roof & wet areas"]},{"group":"Flooring & Finishes","items":["Italian-inspired vitrified tiles (800x1600mm) in living & dining","Anti-skid matte ceramic tiles in balconies and bathrooms","Textured exterior weather-coat paint with architectural cornices"]},{"group":"Electrical & Tech","items":["Concealed copper wiring (Finolex / Havells) with modular switches","Provisions for split AC in all bedrooms and living salon","High-speed FTTH optical fiber conduits and EV charging point provision"]},{"group":"Sanitary & Plumbing","items":["Premium CP fittings (Kohler / Jaquar or equivalent)","Wall-hung EWCs with concealed soft-close cisterns","Dual-plumbing system for treated greywater garden flush"]}]', '/media/img/2025/04/DJI_0788-3-scaled-1920.webp', '2026-01-01 00:00:00', '2026-01-01 00:00:00');
